<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A multi-apk bundle: base.apk + split apks in one zip (.xapk / .apks / .apkm;
  see XapkPack / ApkBundleInstall).

  Same robot as ic_file_apk so the two read as one family, shrunk and set on a stack of
  two plates — the whole point of these formats is "more than one apk in there". These icons
  are flat silhouettes (white fill + android:tint), so layered shapes would merge into a
  blob: every part is kept separate by a gap instead of overlapping. The green is one
  step deeper than the apk icon's, enough to tell them apart in a list at a glance.
-->
